--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  topgun_or_prune_nonempty_drains_total        [POPULATN] n=12 empty=0 min=0 max=3
  topgun_or_prune_split_recomputes_total       [POPULATN] n=12 empty=0 min=2 max=9
  topgun_or_prune_indexed_refs                 [POPULATN] n=12 empty=0 min=350 max=1887
  topgun_or_prune_eligible_refs                [POPULATN] n=12 empty=0 min=0 max=1000
  topgun_or_prune_ineligible_refs              [POPULATN] n=12 empty=0 min=64 max=1069

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
THE ROWS THEMSELVES (verbatim from the produced prune.csv)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  row   eligible   ineligible nonempty_drains  split_recomputes
  1     0          64         0                2
  2     0          64         0                2
  3     0          1065       0                3
  4     0          1065       0                3
